WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:02.940
Afternoon, everyone!

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.900
Tomorrow starts your long awaited summer vacation!

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.650
Those of you who are going to the ocean, mountains,

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.360
rivers, valleys, and PriPara,

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.320
make sure to fully enjoy your youth,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.910
and deepen your friendships!

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.790
However!

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.480
Remember to do your homework!

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.950
You'd better not forget about it!

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:29.960
That's all. Dismissed!

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.350
It's summer vacation!

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.380
Nao, let's have a lot of fun this summer!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.640
Of course!

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.640
And I can go to PriPara with you this year!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.670
That's right!

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.250
We'll go to PriPara, and the pool,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.150
and PriPara, and the pool, and PriPara, and the pool...

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.760
Um... What about our homework?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.320
Midorikaze-san.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:53.840
Even though you're starting summer vacation,

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.460
we will be continuing our Princess lessons every day as per usual.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.280
Give it your all.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.250
Yes, I'll do my best!

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:05.000
Fuwari sure is fired up!

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:40.110
A Date with Prince and the Goat.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.050
And a un, deux, trois.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:52.040
Un, deux, trois.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.720
Elegant and beautiful...

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.210
The world is my oyster.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.200
I will rise to the top.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:02.730
A sparkling, gorgeous celeb princess!

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.830
And to do that requires heart, technique, and physique.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:10.290
You must wholeheartedly become a princess!

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.290
It seems you still have a long way to go.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:20.680
However, compared to when you started, you've made a lot of progress.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.010
Thank you very much, Miss Gloria.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:27.470
I'm being tough on you since I want you to win the GranPrix.

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:29.690
GrandPrix?

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:34.440
With whom should I form a five person team with, I wonder?

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:38.150
I'm sure Hibiki-sama is figuring that out.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.600
Anyway, that is all for today's lesson.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.120
After this, you should practise what we've worked on today.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.580
Thank you very much.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.870
Now then, have a nice day.

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.290
Unacceptable!

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.340
We're here to determine the additional two members who will join us...

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.800
...in the Summer Dream Idol GrandPrix-pri!

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:06.410
First, we've already agreed on Fuwari.

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.190
We haven't asked her yet, though.

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.440
Lala, we'll leave that to you-kuma.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.990
It seems you're the one who talks to her the most-kuma.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:15.210
Capisce!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:16.740
The other could be...

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.400
Kyupikon!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.790
...Nanami-chan!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.660
I don't think so-pri.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.490
Iroha already turned us down...

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.750
That girl?

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:30.220
The one we put on a passionate concert with that one time?

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:33.620
Didn't she join with New & Mew and that other girl?

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.710
They're already of one mind and body.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:40.240
I guess this time we'll try leaving it to our manager.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.730
Usa?

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.670
We've already decided on Fuwari, but...

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:46.130
Go and find someone for us.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:49.640
Someone who is highly skilled and will join us and win.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.350
Usa!

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.750
You say that, but with how much I've had to tend to Dressing Parfait recently,

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.810
I've been completely unmotivated to go out scouting-usa.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.950
It's a manager's job to scout others-usa!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:05.270
But to find someone who can win...

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:08.370
We have no choice but to bring someone in from outside PriPara.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.080
Woah, we can do something like that?!

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.160
Impossible-usa.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:16.710
As you can probably tell, I don't have that many connections-usa.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:19.790
That's true.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.760
Elegant and beautiful.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.590
The world is my oyster.

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:32.890
I will rise to the top.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:37.880
And become a sparkling gorgeous celeb princess!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.600
That's wonderful-tori!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:45.740
Toriko saw a sparkling princess-tori!

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:50.580
Compared to Fuwari, Toriko is a plain, worthless, overshadowed piece of rubbish.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.260
Hey, Toriko,

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:56.290
I wonder what "rise to the top" actually means.

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:59.950
It means that everyone else is below you-tori.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.000
You'd be a princess that will stand at the top-tori.

00:06:03.430 --> 00:06:07.290
Compared to that, Toriko is a plain, worthless, overshadowed piece of rubbish...

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:10.220
Isn't that lonely?

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:11.990
Tori?

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:15.890
Wouldn't it be lonely to stand above everyone else?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.600
I want to be with everyone...

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:24.820
Fuwari, but then you wouldn't be a princess-tori!

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.200
Prince-sama's Making Drama is truly wonderful.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.830
I sparkle and shine...

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:42.720
But I'm not understanding it any more.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.800
I wonder if it's the right fit for me.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:47.760
Huh? Why?

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.320
Well...

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:52.090
Wait, did you just speak like a human?!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.810
Lala, why are you at school?

00:06:56.420 --> 00:07:00.010
I came because I wanted to ask you to join our Dream Team.

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:02.270
Ah! Why are you here, Lala!

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.030
Dorthy-san.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.480
You're trying to get the jump on us!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:10.360
It's like I keep saying, Fuwari's joining Dressing Parfait, right?

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:14.790
Eh?! I want her to join SoLaMi Smile!

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:16.580
Not happening.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.800
To put it simply, having the princess candidate join your team would be a cheap way to win.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:21.950
Same goes to you!

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.870
No, we're different.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.630
How are you different?

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:29.170
I wonder if I can become the princess.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:29.880
Huh?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.260
So Shikyouin-san gave you a Making Drama as a present.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:37.790
Yeah.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.480
However, it's not going well.

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:46.320
Something like the "world is my oyster" doesn't really seem like me.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.480
Eh? Why?

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:52.350
Well, "the world is my oyster" is something I can max agree with.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.300
I do have the qualities of a princess, you know.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.530
Dorthy-san...

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:00.500
Maybe someone more suitable like Dorthy should be the princess.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.280
Really?

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:04.830
Then let's go talk to Shikyouin-san.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.960
I don't think that's what she meant...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.180
All right, Hibiki-san, give us a sharp gaze.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.100
Yeah, that's great. Show more emotion!

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.770
Yes, that'll do!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.270
Great!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.810
Yeah!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.560
All right, thank you, everyone. We're done for the day.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:28.820
You did well.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.640
Thanks.

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:31.620
What is it?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.780
Oh, I see.

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:36.440
Got it.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.170
The world is my oyster....

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.160
Prince-sama!

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.890
Prince-sama!

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.190
I'm sorry I'm so busy and can't see you more.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:14.360
Could these roses possibly be enough to beg your forgiveness?

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.370
Um...

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:21.830
I forgive you.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:26.280
Your lack of sentence enders soothes my beating heart.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.260
The one who knows not of uncleanliness,

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.330
with a heart of pure white,

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.050
and is the ultimate princess candidate,

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:35.760
would you go on a date with me?

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:46.230
Hold on tight.

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.060
Okay!

00:09:49.490 --> 00:09:53.230
Let's perform the Making Drama I gave you.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:54.380
Okay!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.780
It's beautiful!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.790
Is this really me?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:08.500
A beautiful dress fitting of a beautiful princess.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.210
And to top it off...

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.110
Wow!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.340
Delicious!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.490
Wow!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.870
I humbly receive this meal.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:33.570
This is the spoon you use for dessert.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:35.210
R-Right.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.970
Beautiful.

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.200
Eh?!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:43.660
Your smile is as the summer sun, sparkling through the trees.

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.120
Look...

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:51.260
You're so radiant, even the lobster is blushing!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:51.880
See?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.090
Beautiful girl...

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.160
Would you be willing to dance with me?

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.050
I'd love to.

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.840
They're beautiful.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:08.980
Gorgeous.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:14.360
This step...

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.070
This sense of rhythm...

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:18.280
Look how good you are.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.970
<i>Could I...</i>

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.490
<i>...really be?</i>

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.260
I've been lonely.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:35.660
As I am known as a prince in this glamorous world,

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:38.420
all the women who approach me are nothing but shams.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:43.540
Ah, how love's tender touch has escaped my grasp!

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.940
As have the roses of passion!

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:48.390
But I have finally found them.

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:55.810
Take my hand and become the true princess!

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:11.030
I'm looking forward to your concert tomorrow, Fuwari.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.850
Show me the you who has been dyed in my colour.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.380
I will.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.990
Keep them balanced.

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:34.680
Stand up straight.

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:35.520
That's right.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.210
You're doing wonderful.

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.110
Do your feet hurt?

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.490
You're not even going to take them off during your break?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.050
Nope!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:53.960
A princess must always wear elegant footwear.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.930
<i>Elegant and beautiful...</i>

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.600
<i>The world is my oyster.</i>

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:06.140
<i>I will rise above everyone else.</i>

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:11.560
Shine! Gorgeous Celeb Princess!

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:15.410
The world is my oyster!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:23.440
<i>Wholeheartedly become a princess.</i>

00:13:23.930 --> 00:13:26.750
<i>The world is my oyster...</i>

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.280
That isn't wholehearted...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.370
Someone tell me what I should do!

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.300
Capisce.

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.480
Lala?

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.280
I'm here again.

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:44.340
Um... What should I tell you?

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:50.300
I came here to become a princess, yet...

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.020
Lala, what should I do?

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.180
Um...

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.980
T-That's pretty difficult.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:02.230
I'm sorry, I have no idea.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:03.820
I see.

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:08.590
Well, if you're not sure what to do,

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.940
why don't you blow it away?

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:12.200
Blow it away?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.470
Yeah.

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:16.190
If you put everything into exercising,

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.420
and just concentrate on having fun,

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:22.290
eventually you'll be like "Huh? What was I even worried about?"

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:24.630
That sounds great!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.430
Ah! Lala's trying to get the jump on us again!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.090
Dorthy, relax.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.930
Dressing Parfait!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.060
Let's all go play together.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:36.330
Huh?

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.270
What's got into you suddenly?

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:42.480
With the SummDrea so close, we don't have the ti-

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:48.450
The Daruma has fallen over!

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:57.370
Lala-san has fallen over!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.330
Capisce!
Max capisce!

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:04.800
Mirelle-san has fallen over!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.230
Gotcha!

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.250
Gotcha...

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:09.920
You moved, Dorthy!

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.070
I did not!

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:11.780
You did too!

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:12.830
No way!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:13.590
You did!
Relax you two.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:14.970
Did not!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.910
Stop right there!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.440
Why you!

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.650
Leona, this way!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.490
If you want to go that way, Dorthy...

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.170
Fuwari, let's go that way!

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:32.730
Oh, okay!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:35.130
Oh my! I'm about to catch you!

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:36.520
Eh?!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:38.500
Rawr!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.570
Got ya!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.540
Stop!

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:45.050
Capisce catch!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.930
Now you're it, Fuwari-chan.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:57.570
Oh, okay!

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:04.110
Is it okay if I take you off for a little, shoes-san?

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.330
Fuwari!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.870
Over here!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.580
I'll get you!

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:23.460
Hold it!

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:25.420
Wait up!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.130
She's fast!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:32.420
Eh?

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:33.590
Huh?

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.340
Crap!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.300
Huh?

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.980
You all came?

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.690
Let's race!

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:20.620
We climbed a tree together the first time I met you.

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:21.680
We did.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:25.250
Ever since then, I've always thought that...

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:27.400
...being with you is a lot of fun.

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.730
Ever since then?

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.620
Yeah.

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:34.360
Ever since the first time we met.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:39.830
<i>You're far more fascinating now than when we first met.</i>

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.790
Is that true?

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.250
What are those two doing?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.210
I'm not sure.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:51.680
Uh-oh. I forgot to practise.

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.560
From Fuwari?

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:07.350
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.320
Coord Change Start!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:15.800
A coord that represents the clear water and blue skies in the Palps.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:17.810
It's a coord that Mother Earth would love.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:20.350
Palps Sky Country Coord!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:29.220
<i>I'm sorry, but please wait just a little longer.</i>

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:33.020
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.030
Let's go!!

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:55.680
A mysterious spring orchestra!!

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:01.110
Cyalume Change!!

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:34.040
You're awesome, Fuwari-chan!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.110
You really are!

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:39.680
Fuwari-chan did really good.

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:41.840
Yeah, it was super cute.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:44.970
I want her in SoLaMi Smile more and more-pri

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:46.830
That's right.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.720
I'm counting on you.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.890
I am unaccustomed to waiting.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.330
We'll need to take drastic measures with the princess.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:11.930
I wonder if I upset Prince-sama.

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:08.020
Celebrity 4?

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:09.230
What's that?

